  "subject": "a woman awake at 3 a.m. counting the rhythm of the upstairs air-conditioner dripping onto her metal window awning, and finally going up in her slippers to knock",
  "caption": "Cantonese IDM electronica in the Warp Records tradition. Glitched granular percussion and clicks, broken-beat drum programming that shifts accents every few bars, a detuned FM bell synth playing small repeating figures, a warm sine bass and a recorded water drip tapping on metal worked into the rhythm. Intricate dry mix with stereo detail and a small room, no big reverb. A breathy female alto sung close and quiet with conversational phrasing. 96 BPM, E minor. Sleepless, curious and drily amused. No four-on-the-floor kick, no trap, no autotune, no EDM drop, no piano ballad.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n三點零五 我仲未瞓\n樓上部冷氣 滴落我個鐵蓬\n答 答 答答\n好似有人 喺窗外打字\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我數住佢 一二三四\n第五下 總係遲少少\n\n[Chorus]\n冷氣滴水 滴喺我窗口\n滴到我記得 佢嘅節奏\n我塞住耳塞 佢照入耳仔\n成個香港瞓晒 淨低我同佢\n\n[Verse]\n我開燈 我煲埋水\n我試吓 用匙羹敲埋一份\n答 答 叮\n其實 都幾好聽\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n四點正 我著對拖鞋\n行上一層 撳佢門鐘\n\n[Chorus]\n冷氣滴水 個阿叔開門\n佢著住背心 佢都未瞓\n佢話佢屋企 都好嘈\n樓上部冷氣 滴落佢個鐵蓬\n\n[Bridge]\n我哋兩個 企喺樓梯\n一齊行上 再上一層\n\n[Chorus]\n冷氣滴水 一層滴一層\n成棟樓 喺度打緊拍子\n三個人 喺走廊笑到彎腰\n冇人瞓 但係冇人嬲\n\n[Outro]\n答 答 答答 天光咗",
